<title>USA: Dade Cty, Fla., schools set Feb 25 for bond sale.</title>
<headline>Dade Cty, Fla., schools set Feb 25 for bond sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dade County School District, Fla., plans to sell $140 million of bonds in a competitive offering on Feb 25, the financial adviser said Thursday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
